          {
            "id": "s1:p1",
            "text": "Pyracantha koidzumii commonly known as Formosa firethorn or Taiwan firethorn, is a species of plant in the family Rosaceae. It is threatened by habitat loss."
          },
          {
            "id": "s1:p2",
            "text": "Description and distribution\nThe species is {{convert|4|m}} tall and is native to Taiwan. However, it has been introduced to US states such as Alabama, Arkansas, Georgia, Florida and South Carolina."
          }
